        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.15.37+NUM.15.38+NUM.15.39+NUM.15.40+NUM.15.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kubar 15:37-41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oyekorrege ebitutu ha byebu bbina eby'ekijwaro kyawe ekyoyenagira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebiragiro ebirukukwata ha burukwera",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omusaija kakuba agabura omukazi akatemba ekitabu kye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi akamuhangirra engeso erukumuhemura, hanyuma akamunoba akamutaho ibara libi naagamba ati: ‘Nkaleeta omukazi onu, mahano, obunamuhikire ntamusange.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu, ise na nyina omukazi ogu empikiirre, bakwate ekyokubyamira ekirukwoleka obuhikiriire bwe, babitwale omurukurato rw'abakuru b'orubuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ise omukazi ayasangirwe, agambire abakuru b'enganda ati: ‘Muhara wange nkamugabira omusaija onu amuswere, hati tarukumwenda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi mahano, amuhemwire naagamba ati: Muhara wanyu ntamusange mpikiirre. Kandi kunu, haroho obwakaiso mbunu, oburukugumya muhara wange nkooku akaba ali mpikirre.’ Banjurre ekyokubyamira omumaiso g'abakuru b'orubuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, bakuru b'orubuga bakwate omusaija; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bamuteere, bamulehese ebicweeka by'efeeza kikumi, bagihe ise omukazi ayasangirwe ali mpikiirre, habwokuba omwisiki empikirre ow'omu Isirairi, amutaireho ibara libi, kandi aikale ali mukazi we, atalimwanga obwomeezi bwe bwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu ekintu kakuba kiba ky'amazima, hataroho bwakaiso oburukwoleka, ngu omukazi ogu nkooku akaba ali mpikirre kwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obu, baleete omukazi ogu ha mulyango gwa ise, abasaija ab'omurubuga bamuteere amabaale afe, habwokuba, anugisize Isirairi, naakorra obwamalaya omunju ya ise; nukwo mwihe muti ekibi omuli inywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omusaija kakuba akwatwa abyamire na mukazi muk'omusaija, bombi omusaija n'omukazi baitwe, nukwo mwihe muti ekibi omu Isirairi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kakuba habaho omwisiki empikirre anyakujumbiirwe, omusaija akamwitirana omurubuga akabyama na uwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
