              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obu, omusaija ayamuhambire, ahe ise omwisiki efeeza erukuhikya ebicweeka makumi ataano, omwisiki abe mukazi w'omusaija ogu, habwokuba nuwe yamuhambire, atalimwanga ebiro bye byona.",
